{"additions":407,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nCloses #168.\n\n- **One refresh scale for the app** — `core::api_budget` keeps the GraphQL points left, reported by every custom query vig sends (the Projects views query and the GitHub page's PR-stacks query now both piggy-back `rateLimit { remaining }`, cost 0). `AppContext::refresh_scale()` turns it into a multiplier: **×6 when idle** (10 minutes without a key press — `App::handle_key` stamps `last_input`), **×2 under 20 %** of the hourly 5,000 points, **stopped under 5 %** or with `github-auto-refresh \"off\"`; idle and quota compound. Manual `r` is never affected.\n- **GitHub page** — `on_tick` scales `github-poll-interval` by it (capped at 10 minutes) for the runs list, the PR checks watch and the run jobs / log polls, and skips polling entirely when stopped.\n- **Projects page** — the stale-on-activate threshold scales the same way, and before re-fetching, the page **re-reads the shared disk cache**: a board another instance wrote within the last five minutes (and after our own copy) is adopted instead of fetched. N instances on one repository now fetch effectively once per five minutes.\n- **Header** — `idle`, `refresh stopped`, `auto-refresh off` and `⚠ api N left` (below 1,500; red when stopped) render in the shared header on every page; the Projects-only status-bar warning from #164 is folded into it, and `Board.api_remaining` goes away.\n- **Config** — top-level `github-auto-refresh \"on\" | \"off\"` (default on), validated and in the merge allowlist; documented in the Config Reference, Troubleshooting and the Projects chapter (en/ja).\n\n## Not done (from the issue)\n\n- `gh api --cache` for REST polls: the only `gh api` REST poll is a running job's **log** tail, where a 30-second cache would just delay the log; the runs list and jobs go through `gh run` subcommands, which have no cache flag. Nothing to apply, so it is left out.\n\n## Demo\n\nNo GIF changes: the header additions only appear when idle, low on quota, or with auto-refresh off, none of which the recordings hit.\n\n## Tests\n\n`throttle_for` thresholds, `refresh_scale` (idle × quota × off), `github-auto-refresh` validation; every existing `AppContext` literal gains the two fields. 385 tests green, clippy clean.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01TreGn5Xh4PjDRv9Yo4QU4w","changedFiles":24,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-08T08:19:50Z","deletions":56,"headRefName":"feat/quota-guard","labels":[],"number":171,"reviewDecision":"","reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMlG9pQ","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThere are review-blocking concerns around refresh/cache behavior consistency under scaled staleness and missing demo-tape/GIF updates per project conventions.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nThis PR adds app-wide throttling for GitHub-related automatic refresh behavior (idle backoff, quota-aware slowdown/stop, and an auto-refresh kill switch), centralizes GraphQL quota tracking, and updates the UI/docs to reflect the new refresh state and shared cache behavior.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Introduces a process-wide GraphQL quota tracker (`core::api_budget`) and uses it to scale/stop automatic refreshes.\n- Scales GitHub page polling and Projects page “stale-on-activate” refreshes based on idle/quota/kill-switch state; adds disk-cache re-adoption for Projects.\n- Adds `github-auto-refresh` config option and updates default config + documentation accordingly.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| src/projects/state.rs | Scales Projects refresh-on-activate with app refresh scale; adds disk-cache adoption logic; removes per-board API remaining tracking. |\r\n| src/projects/panes/board.rs | Updates test AppContext literals for new fields. |\r\n| src/projects/domain/types.rs | Removes `Board.api_remaining` field now that quota is tracked globally. |\r\n| src/projects/domain/disk_cache.rs | Adjusts disk-cache roundtrip test after removing `api_remaining`; provides `load_board_with_age`. |\r\n| src/projects/domain/client.rs | Notes GraphQL `rateLimit.remaining` into the shared budget tracker. |\r\n| src/procs/state.rs | Updates test AppContext literals for new fields. |\r\n| src/main.rs | Initializes new `AppContext` fields (`last_input`, `auto_refresh`). |\r\n| src/github/state.rs | Scales GitHub polling on tick using `AppContext::scaled_interval`, with a max cap and stop behavior. |\r\n| src/github/domain/client.rs | Piggy-backs `rateLimit { remaining }` on the PR stacks GraphQL query and records it in the shared budget tracker. |\r\n| src/core/ui/status_bar.rs | Moves refresh/quota state into the common header; removes Projects-only status-bar API warning. |\r\n| src/core/mod.rs | Exposes new `core::api_budget` module. |\r\n| src/core/config/merge.rs | Allows `github-auto-refresh` at the top level in merged configs. |\r\n| src/core/config/loader.rs | Adds `github-auto-refresh` parsing/validation and tests. |\r\n| src/core/app.rs | Adds idle detection, refresh scaling helpers, and new AppContext fields; stamps `last_input` on key handling; adds tests. |\r\n| src/core/api_budget.rs | New module tracking remaining GraphQL quota and providing throttle thresholds. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/views-projects.md | Updates Projects docs to reflect header-based quota warning and automatic backoff/stop behavior. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/troubleshooting.md | Documents idle/quota backoff, refresh stopping behavior, shared cache, and `github-auto-refresh` kill switch. |\r\n| docs/guide/src/config-reference.md | Documents `github-auto-refresh` option and updates examples/allowlist text. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/views-projects.md | Japanese docs: moves quota warning to header and notes automatic backoff/stop. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/troubleshooting.md | Japanese troubleshooting: documents idle/quota backoff, refresh stopping, shared cache, and kill switch. |\r\n| docs/guide/ja/src/config-reference.md | Japanese config reference: documents `github-auto-refresh` and updates examples/allowlist text. |\r\n| assets/default.kdl | Adds `github-auto-refresh \"on\"` default and explanatory comment. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 22/22 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 3\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/td72/vig/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T08:24:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"3418e64220d81cbc45d03697dd827d2f2096e9d8"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMlOMWw","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"3418e64220d81cbc45d03697dd827d2f2096e9d8"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMlONyg","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"c647573eb5b04fda404f32054022dee37d2155cd"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMlOO4A","author":{"login":"td72"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:17Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"c647573eb5b04fda404f32054022dee37d2155cd"}},{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABMlSvFA","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThe new cross-instance disk-cache adoption behavior is a key part of the quota-savings goal but currently lacks direct test coverage, making regressions harder to detect.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n### Suppressed comments (1)\n\n**Previously missed (1)** — in code that hasn't changed since the last review.\n\n**src/projects/state.rs:790**\n* The new disk-cache adoption path (skipping a network fetch when another instance refreshed the cache) isn’t covered by tests: the ProjectsState test helper explicitly sets `use_disk_cache = false`, and there’s no assertion that `on_activate` adopts a fresher on-disk board instead of spawning a fetch. Consider adding a unit test by making the projects disk-cache directory injectable/overrideable in tests so a temp cache file can be written and then adopted.\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 24/24 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 1\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>","submittedAt":"2026-09-08T08:42:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"c647573eb5b04fda404f32054022dee37d2155cd"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:56:00Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34207202411/job/101999380373","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:56:01Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:36:36Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34205304744/job/101993286773","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:20Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:56Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34205304693/job/101993285885","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:21Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:36:32Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34205304744/job/101993286351","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:23Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:37:26Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34205304744/job/101993286664","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:28Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:37:27Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34205304744/job/101993908287","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:37:27Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:56:00Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34207202411/job/101999408828","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:56:07Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:36:21Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34205304693/job/101993286436","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:21Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:37:09Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34205304693/job/101993286353","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:35:28Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-09-08T08:56:00Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/34207202411/job/101999427837","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-09-08T08:56:10Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"⚡ Slow automatic refreshes when idle or low on quota; share the board cache; github-auto-refresh"}
